= Vector Spaces

== Summary

This chapter introduces the foundation of the book, which is the concept of vector spaces. Coming from a physics background, the definition of vector spaces could be quite a bit different from what we have been taught, so I think it worths the time to take it slow and let the definitions sink in.

Really try to pay close attention to the properties of vector spaces and subspaces, as there are quite a number of corner cases that deserves extra cares.

== Key questions

 - What is a vector space?
 - What are the subspaces of a vector space?

